Veritope data inventory — licensing

The CATALOG METADATA in this repository (the dataset descriptions, categorizations,
and the index/build files generated from them) is made available by Veritope under
the Creative Commons Attribution 4.0 International License (CC BY 4.0):
https://creativecommons.org/licenses/by/4.0/

This license covers ONLY Veritope's catalog metadata. It does NOT cover the external
datasets described here. Each listed dataset is governed by its own license and access
terms, recorded per entry in the `license`, `license_url`, and `access` fields. Consult
and honor those terms before downloading, redistributing, or training on any dataset.
